# Pre-commit: format staged PHP and frontend files.
#
# `vp staged` (lint-staged) runs the `staged` commands from vite.config.ts on
# the staged files only and re-adds any files the formatters modified, so the
# fixes land in the commit automatically. Formatting never blocks a commit:
# lint errors are caught by `npm run check` / `composer ci:check`.
vp staged
